  "question": {
    "text": "Let there are <math><mn>4</mn></math> sections of <math><mn>25</mn></math> students each in a coaching class. Now, out of <math><mn>150</mn></math> students <math><mn>100</mn></math> are to be selected randomly and enrolled in these sections. Then, the probability that the students&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi></math> (both present in <math><mn>150</mn></math> students) are selected and placed in the same section, is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>149</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>33</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>149</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Probability that <math><mi>A</mi></math> is selected <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>150</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Now, probability that <math><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is in same section <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>149</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Then, the required probability <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>149</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>149</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
  }
}